#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"You can now ask Moose to put together a report, a budget or a set of slides "
"right in your chat. Use Create Document to describe what you need, or turn "
"an answer you already have into a file. Choose PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint "
"or OpenDocument, as well as Markdown, plain text, CSV, HTML, JSON and XML. "
"Your finished files stay with the answer, so you can come back to preview, "
"open or save them later."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"You'll also find these documents in Files. There's a new Generated filter, "
"and you can look them up by name, contents or chat title. We've made the "
"layout easier to browse, and Open Chat takes you straight to the answer "
"behind a document. When you export a chat, JSON includes copies of the "
"files, while Markdown and plain text include their names."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"You can now search for a model in the chat picker and Chat Settings. "
"Attachments leave more room for writing, and document attachments show the "
"file type, size and PDF page count before you open them. When viewing an "
"image, you can fit it to the window, see it at its original size or use the "
"buttons and arrow keys to browse the other images in that message. We also "
"fixed a freeze when pasting images on X11."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"You can now look things up on the web and check calculations without leaving "
"your chat. With a compatible Ollama or Ollama Cloud model, turn on Web or "
"Calculator in Chat Settings, or type /web or /calculator. Web uses "
"DuckDuckGo by default, without a search account, and you can choose another "
"search service in Preferences. It asks for permission first and stays off in "
"Local Only mode. Sources and tool results stay with your chats when you "
"return to them, export them or continue in a new chat."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"The redesigned Models view helps you find a model for everyday questions, "
"coding, pictures or documents. Filters let you narrow the choices, and model "
"details show download size and estimated memory and storage needs. If Moose "
"manages Ollama, suggestions also consider the memory available on your "
"computer. You can start a chat with an installed model right away, and "
"progress messages make downloads and removals easier to follow."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"OpenRouter is now available as another way to chat. Add your key and choose "
"a model, with pictures and reasoning options where supported. We've also "
"made it easier to switch between services and find your chat settings. Chat "
"titles now better reflect your topic and language."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Longer chats with Ollama now leave more room for an answer. If an answer "
"stops because it reaches its length limit, the text stays saved and you can "
"choose Continue to pick up where it stopped. Moose remembers your reasoning "
"preference, with reasoning off by default where supported. We've also "
"improved message spacing to make conversations easier to read."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Download compatible GGUF models from Hugging Face through your Ollama "
"connection. Paste a model link, an Ollama model name or an ollama run or "
"ollama pull command, and optionally choose a quantization or GGUF filename."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Start a new chat from a completed download or use an already installed model "
"from the download dialog. Failed downloads offer an Edit and Retry action "
"with clearer guidance, and download progress now clears when a transfer "
"finishes, fails or is cancelled."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"The initial setup now opens the provider chooser so you can select a local "
"or cloud connection. Chat bubble backgrounds display correctly with custom "
"GTK themes, and model search fits better in narrow windows."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"You can now check for updates, update or repair the Ollama installation "
"managed by Moose right from Preferences. Your models and chats stay put. "
"This release comes with Ollama 0.40.6, lets you pick up interrupted engine "
"downloads and brings back the previous installation if an update fails."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"We've tidied up the setup screens for local and cloud providers. If "
"something goes wrong, you can view and copy Moose and Ollama logs from "
"Diagnostics, or copy the details of a model download or deletion. If a model "
"needs a newer Ollama version, Moose offers to update its managed "
"installation and try the download again."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Tables now fit better in chats and have a button to copy them as Markdown. "
"We also fixed chat bubble sizing. When selecting a long passage, you can "
"drag toward the edge of the chat to scroll and keep selecting."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Connect to NVIDIA NIM and Cloudflare Workers AI, with model discovery, "
"streamed responses, reasoning and image support on compatible models. Model "
"IDs containing spaces now work with compatible cloud providers and custom "
"connections."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Select text more reliably and read Markdown, code and formulas as answers "
"arrive, with scrolling that lets you review earlier content. Chat messages "
"now size correctly, and completed responses remain visible if saving fails."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Managed Ollama now stops when Moose closes and prevents conflicting "
"instances from using the same installation. Model downloads report provider "
"errors and incomplete transfers instead of appearing to finish successfully."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Connect to Mistral AI and DeepSeek, or add a custom cloud provider with your "
"own server address and authentication settings."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Discover models automatically or add them manually, with image support "
"configurable for each saved model."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"This update also adds reasoning controls for supported Mistral and DeepSeek "
"models and fixes managed Ollama installation in folders accessed through "
"symbolic links."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Connect securely to cloud providers using your own API key and control what "
"you share."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Enable Local Only mode to restrict inference to Ollama managed by Moose."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Allow messages in all chats with a provider or ask in each chat. File "
"sharing requires separate permission. Review context before sending and "
"reset permissions in Privacy settings."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Open Files from the sidebar to browse, search and filter attachments and "
"library documents. Preview files, find their original folder, reopen related "
"chats or attach them to the current chat."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Browse more local models for chat, vision, reasoning and coding."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"See clearer waiting and reasoning indicators that disappear when the answer "
"starts arriving."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"External Ollama connections now require HTTPS, with HTTP available only for "
"connections on this device."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Bring images and documents into your conversations. Attach photos, PDFs, "
"text and code, or search your local document library with source excerpts "
"and page references."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Edit messages in place, regenerate answers and switch between saved versions "
"or continue in a separate chat."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"View model reasoning separately and choose the reasoning options supported "
"by your model."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Keep drafts and attachments between sessions, move between chats during a "
"response and receive a completion notification."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Review model download history, retry interrupted downloads and keep chatting "
"while a model downloads."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Read mathematical formulas with local rendering, scrolling for long "
"expressions and access to the original LaTeX."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Use a wider, aligned chat and composer, compact model controls, clearer "
"attachment previews and helpful starting suggestions."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Adds GPU acceleration support for managed Ollama through Vulkan when "
"available."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Adds a managed hardware preference so GPU acceleration can be enabled or "
"disabled."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Shows the active managed Ollama acceleration backend in the provider status."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Adds configurable keyboard shortcuts for common chat, model and navigation "
"actions."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Adds a shortcuts page to preferences so shortcuts can be changed, cleared or "
"reset."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Shows when the active conversation is generating a response in the "
"conversation list."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Adds tools to organize conversation history so older chats are easier to "
"review and manage."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Adds conversation export support for saving chats outside Moose."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Conversations now include recent message history so models can follow the "
"thread."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Adds per-chat settings for system prompts, preferred models, context limits "
"and Ollama generation options."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Introduces built-in chat profiles and reusable custom profiles that stay on "
"your device."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Improves the sidebar and provider switcher with a cleaner layout."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fixes visual bugs that appeared when using light mode."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Moose now renders chat messages with Markdown formatting for clearer model "
"responses."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Code blocks include syntax highlighting, line numbers and a copy action so "
"generated code is easier to read and reuse."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Moose now opens just once when launched from Flathub."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Adds Moose-managed Ollama so the Flatpak works without a host Ollama "
"installation."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Fresh installs can create an instance, download a model and chat. Nice."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.moooossee.Moose.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"First version of Moose, with local Ollama chat, saved conversations, "
"provider settings and basic model management."
msgstr ""

