"Sets Ollama’s context size in tokens, shared by the conversation, reasoning, "
"and response. Moose uses 16,384 when this field is empty. Up to half the "
"window, capped at 8,192 tokens, is reserved for reasoning and the response, "
"with an additional safety margin. Text and image sizes are estimates, so "
"very long responses can still reach the limit. Larger windows use more "
"memory; Moose does not increase this setting automatically."
msgstr ""

